  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "ESG永續管理實務與認證",
    "sub_ename": "ESG SUSTAINABLE MANAGEMENT PRACTICES AND CERTIFICATION",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在培養學生對ESG（環境、社會、公司治理）永續管理的實務操作能力，並結合國內ESG相關認證制度，提升學生在職場上的競爭力。課程內容涵蓋ESG基本概念、永續報告書撰寫、指標分析、企業實務案例及認證考試準備，目標是協助學生取得 ESG專業證照。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to equip students with practical skills in ESG (Environmental, Social, and Governance) sustainability management. It integrates domestic ESG certification systems to enhance students' competitiveness in the job market. Topics include ESG fundamentals, sustainability report writing, indicator analysis, corporate case studies, and certification exam preparation to help students obtain ESG Manager qualifications.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
